# "+1: You may exile a nonland card with mana value 3 or less from your hand. If you do, it becomes plotted." Bot1's hand holds
# Island (a land), Wrath of God (mana value 4) and Lightning Bolt (1): only the Bolt may be chosen (the others are refused),
# and it is exiled and plotted. It can't be cast the turn it became plotted, but on turn 9 Bot1 casts it from exile without
# paying its mana cost (Bot1 has no red source for the Bolt's {R}) and Bot2 takes 3.

